{"suttaId":"an8.5","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-viii","vriCode":"s0404m1.mul","paras":[50,62],"vripara":"5"},"segments":{"an8.5:0.3":"Paṭhamalokadhammasuttaṃ","an8.5:1.1":"“Aṭṭhime, bhikkhave, lokadhammā lokaṃ anuparivattanti, loko ca aṭṭha lokadhamme anuparivattati.","an8.5:1.2":"Katame aṭṭha?","an8.5:1.3":"Lābho ca, alābho ca, yaso ca, ayaso ca, nindā ca, pasaṃsā ca, sukhañca, dukkhañca.","an8.5:1.4":"Ime kho, bhikkhave, aṭṭha lokadhammā lokaṃ anuparivattanti, loko ca ime aṭṭha lokadhamme anuparivattatī”ti.","an8.5:2.1":"“Lābho alābho ca yasāyaso ca,","an8.5:2.2":"Nindā pasaṃsā ca sukhaṃ dukhañca;","an8.5:2.3":"Ete aniccā manujesu dhammā,","an8.5:2.4":"Asassatā vipariṇāmadhammā.","an8.5:3.1":"“Ete ca ñatvā satimā sumedho,","an8.5:3.2":"Avekkhati vipariṇāmadhamme;","an8.5:3.3":"Iṭṭhassa dhammā na mathenti cittaṃ,","an8.5:3.4":"Aniṭṭhato no paṭighātameti.","an8.5:4.1":"“Tassānurodhā atha vā virodhā,","an8.5:4.2":"Vidhūpitā atthaṅgatā na santi;","an8.5:4.3":"Padañca ñatvā virajaṃ asokaṃ,","an8.5:4.4":"Sammappajānāti bhavassa pāragū”ti.","an8.5:4.5":"pañcamaṃ; 6."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-viii","bookName":"Aṭṭhakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0404a.att","from":17,"to":18,"paras":[{"para":17,"vripara":"5","refs":["an8.5:1"],"lines":["Pañcame lokassa dhammāti <b>lokadhammā</b>.","Etehi muttā nāma natthi, buddhānampi honti.","Tenevāha – <b>lokaṃ anuparivattantī</b>ti anubandhanti nappajahanti, lokato na nivattantīti attho.","<b>Loko ca aṭṭha lokadhamme anuparivattatī</b>ti ayañca loko ete anubandhati na pajahati, tehi dhammehi na nivattatīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["an8.5:1"],["an8.5:1"],["an8.5:1"],["an8.5:1"]]},{"para":18,"vripara":null,"refs":["an8.5:2","an8.5:3","an8.5:4"],"lines":["<b>Lābho alābho</b>ti lābhe āgate alābho āgatoyevāti veditabbo.","<b>Ayasā</b>dīsupi eseva nayo.","<b>Avekkhati vipariṇāmadhamme</b>ti “vipariṇāmadhammā ime”ti evaṃ avekkhati.","<b>Vidhūpitā</b>ti vidhamitā viddhaṃsitā.","<b>Padañca ñatvā</b>ti nibbānapadaṃ jānitvā.","<b>Sammappajānāti bhavassa pāragū</b>ti bhavassa pāraṃ gato nipphattiṃ matthakaṃ patto, nibbānapadaṃ ñatvāva taṃ pāraṃ gatabhāvaṃ sammappajānātīti.","Imasmiṃ sutte vaṭṭavivaṭṭaṃ kathitaṃ. 6."],"lineRefs":[["an8.5:2"],["an8.5:2"],["an8.5:3"],["an8.5:4"],["an8.5:4"],["an8.5:4"],["an8.5:4"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an8.5:1.1","lokadhammā",0,0],["an8.5:1.4","lokadhammā",0,0],["an8.5:1.1","lokaṃ anuparivattantī",0,2],["an8.5:1.4","lokaṃ anuparivattantī",0,2],["an8.5:1.1","loko ca aṭṭha lokadhamme anuparivattatī",0,3],["an8.5:2.1","lābho alābho",1,0],["an8.5:2.1","ayasā",1,1],["an8.5:3.2","avekkhati vipariṇāmadhamme",1,2],["an8.5:4.2","vidhūpitā",1,3],["an8.5:4.3","padañca ñatvā",1,4],["an8.5:4.4","sammappajānāti bhavassa pāragū",1,5]]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-viii","bookName":"Aṭṭhakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0404t.tik","from":23,"to":23,"paras":[{"para":23,"vripara":"5","refs":["an8.5:1"],"lines":["Pañcame <b>lokassa dhammā</b>ti sattalokassa avassaṃbhāvidhammā.","Tenāha <b>“etehi muttā nāma natthi”</b>tiādi.","Ghāsacchādanādīnaṃ laddhi <b>lābho,</b> tāni eva vā laddhabbato <b>lābho,</b> tadabhāvo <b>alābho,</b> lābhaggahaṇena cettha tabbisayo anurodho gahito, alābhaggahaṇena virodho.","Yasmā lohite sati tadupaghātavasena pubbo viya anurodho laddhāvasaro eva hoti, tasmā vuttaṃ <b>“lābhe āgate alābho āgatoyevā”</b>ti.","Esa nayo yasādīsupi.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyameva."],"lineRefs":[["an8.5:1"],["an8.5:1"],["an8.5:1"],["an8.5:1"],["an8.5:1"],["an8.5:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an8.5:1.3","alābho",0,2],["an8.5:1.3","lābho",0,2]],"after":[{"para":24,"vripara":null,"title":"Paṭhamalokadhammasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Paṭhamalokadhammasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 6-8."]}]},"tika2":null}
